Preheat the oven to 200°C.

Prepare the garlic butter by mixing the @butter{}, @garlic{}(finely minced), and (if using) @?flat-leafed parsley{} together.

Cut parallel slices about ⅔ of the way through the @part-baked baguette{}. Generously spread garlic butter into each cut.

Wrap loosely in foil and bake for 8 to ~{10%minutes}.

Unwrap and bake uncovered for a further ~{5%minutes}.